  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/efc9c439890e2458a49c79a6a987ffd640c3292b.png\" alt=\"標誌\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fchomik_oto\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e57558e6fff9baa59db405ece347f9274cb593ee.webp\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252f3d-workbenches\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f5e493b29e9cadd97cdc6a4428821b6f95eefd55.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/TJqmSYqyuu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b4deece41b27fd615591464722fbfaa563b57f7b.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\"></a>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>更多詳情：</strong></p></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">每一個工作台（工作台、製造者、鍛造台等）都擁有真正的 3D 模型，細節豐富，並採用原版紋理，完美契合原版風格！</p>\n<p>‎</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>3D 工作台展示：</strong></p></h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>3D 工作台</th>\n<th>3D 製造者</th>\n<th>3D 製圖台</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e9af0a54a9852e2a24e5ba77c571910cac952f0d.png\" alt=\"工作台模型展示\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d0e87e1c204a04d087681f9f06cde0333cb64f66.png\" alt=\"製造者模型展示\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cd3f50d6ded5eb9615e988b5a68cbd2a24fec77d.png\" alt=\"全新製圖台模型展示\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>3D 箭頭加工台</strong></td>\n<td><strong>3D 鍛造台</strong></td>\n<td><strong>3D 切石機</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d0667036195a9ac0264ee5edc3986f20855a1562.png\" alt=\"箭頭加工台模型展示\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/41200b80914a606548ee6366574d9b82378d7bd3.png\" alt=\"鍛造台模型展示\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/12b1b006f441a355a188e68496c65fcf22fc5397.gif\" alt=\"切石機模型展示\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>3D 附魔台</strong></td>\n<td><strong>3D 織布機</strong></td>\n<td><strong>3D 木桶</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7ae576523c7f806bbb900df383f83796de7a3251_0.webp\" alt=\"附魔台模型展示\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/184707324df55cfbdf155cd47c491b932c9816f2.png\" alt=\"織布機模型展示\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9a1d5c4f9fcb824bd035a03207bccea273bcc993.gif\" alt=\"木桶模型展示\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>3D 講臺</strong></td>\n<td><strong>3D 煉藥釜</strong></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/656bbe044ab0aceafd60c4a15304ad8709bd925a_0.webp\" alt=\"講臺模型展示\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6caf42f309915c0658ff89d22d6de05735a1173b.png\" alt=\"煉藥釜模型展示\"></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>前往畫廊查看更多圖片！</strong></p></h3>\n<hr>\n<p>‎</p>\n<h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>獲取更多我的「真實 3D」資源包！</strong></p></h1>\n<h1><p style=\"text-align:center\">（於 Modrinth 上）</p></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252f3d-furnaces\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1f3b527142094e27ea4dd3da078ac204f0dab2f2.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"100\"></a>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7c374c6612526aa5466c785547fb9c5095faf6f1_0.webp\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252factually-3d-ladders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/852711e47145875047f2ae6e0d2b0037b285e62f.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"100\"></a>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>未來計畫：</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">這是我的「真實 3D」資源包合集的首發作品，希望未來能持續擴展，為遊戲中現有的方塊甚至物品增添新穎且細緻的 3D 模型！我計劃將每個子資源包（如：熔爐、工作台、礦石等）獨立發布，同時也會將其整合至主「真實 3D」資源包中，實現所有「真實 3D」資源包合而為一。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fcollection%252fWUhIlXT7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/02c09bf73e5f9b9a9f2a4d9a4c01ad8642e6e4b7.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"100\"></a></p></div>",
